  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In scenarios where you would normally have your view locked (e.g. Quick Menu open or holding the Tab key), sometimes you will still be able to look around. The most consistent way to do this is to spawn the Drone, press esc to release control from it, then press esc again to de-spawn the Drone. The Quick Menu cannot be interacted with in this state. I've also encountered this using OSC to send \"Use\" inputs which prevented the Tab key from locking the view direction.",
